    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 12,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Izlude, the satellite of Prontera. Izlude was built to support Prontera's defense and to accommodate its burgeoning population.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到依斯魯得，這座普隆德拉的衛星城。依斯魯得是為支援普隆德拉的防務、容納不斷增加的人口而建成的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 14,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯魯得：普隆德拉的衛星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 15,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Points of interest include the Swordsman Association building which allows adventurers to change their job to Swordsman, and the Battle Area that is North of Izlude.",
      "translation" : "這裡有劍士公會大樓，冒險者可以在那裡轉職為劍士；依斯魯得北邊還有戰鬥區域。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 17,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯魯得：普隆德拉的衛星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "At the docks, you may take a ship and travel to ^123972Alberta^000000 or ^2F0400Byalan Island^000000.",
      "translation" : "你可以在碼頭搭船前往^123972艾爾貝塔^000000或^2F0400海底洞窟^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Izlude: The Satellite City]",
      "translation" : "[依斯魯得：普隆德拉的衛星城]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From Izlude, ^6D6FE0Prontera^000000 is located to the Northwest, and ^1F3A11Payon^000000 is located to the South.",
      "translation" : "從依斯魯得向西北可到達^6D6FE0普隆德拉^000000，向南可到達^1F3A11斐揚^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Bulletin Board",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Enjoy your travels in the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom.",
      "translation" : "祝你在盧恩-米德加爾特王國旅途愉快。"
    },
